  <h2>The Home Services Copywriting Framework</h2>

  <p>
    Home services content follows a consistent pattern:
  </p>

  <ol>
    <li><strong>Lead with local trust</strong> — Emphasize community presence and local reputation.</li>
    <li><strong>Educate to differentiate</strong> — Show expertise through helpful content, not just claims.</li>
    <li><strong>Address the scam concern</strong> — Many industries have bad actors. Acknowledge this and show how you're different.</li>
    <li><strong>Make getting a quote easy</strong> — Low-friction CTAs for estimates and consultations.</li>
  </ol>

